  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "A warehousing order you enter by hand has no sales or purchase order behind it, so its number comes from Warehousing's own number group. LN fills in the origin, the transaction type and the order type, and you check them. For a transfer inside one company, LN puts both halves of the move on this one order: the outbound and shipment steps, then the inbound and inspection steps."
      }
